{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🟢 INICIO\nDispara el flujo manualmente.\nEn producción, sustituye este nodo por un **Schedule Trigger** (ej. cada 15-30 min) para que la sincronización sea automática.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1760, 1320],
      "id": "note-1",
      "name": "Nota - Trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1760, 1568],
      "id": "998544f6-a6ff-4814-876e-3c87dd6c40fe",
      "name": "Ejecutar manualmente"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📅 LEER GOOGLE CALENDAR\nTrae TODOS los eventos futuros del calendario configurado.\n\n⚠️ Sustituye el ID del calendario y conecta tus propias credenciales de Google Calendar OAuth2 (se eliminaron por seguridad).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1536, 1300],
      "id": "note-2",
      "name": "Nota - Google Calendar"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "TU_CALENDAR_ID@group.calendar.google.com",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Nombre del calendario"
        },
        "returnAll": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [-1536, 1568],
      "id": "d5a08444-fe07-403c-b9fa-44f642eeef3e",
      "name": "Obtener eventos futuros",
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "PON_AQUI_TU_CREDENCIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Calendar (configurar credencial propia)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🧹 LIMPIAR EVENTOS\nDescarta los eventos con status = \"cancelled\" para no crearlos/actualizarlos en el CRM.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1328, 1320],
      "id": "note-3",
      "name": "Nota - Filtro"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "skip1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "cancelled",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-1328, 1568],
      "id": "c800649a-0c6a-41ea-9e75-4b78a328b661",
      "name": "Descartar cancelados"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔧 MAPEAR CAMPOS\nConvierte el formato de Google Calendar al formato que espera EspoCRM:\n- dateStart / dateEnd\n- cGoogleEventId (campo clave para evitar duplicados)\n- name / description",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1104, 1300],
      "id": "note-4",
      "name": "Nota - Formatear"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "dateStart",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.start?.dateTime ? $json.start.dateTime.replace('T',' ').substring(0,19) : ($json.start?.date ? $json.start.date + ' 00:00:00' : '') }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "dateEnd",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.end?.dateTime ? $json.end.dateTime.replace('T',' ').substring(0,19) : ($json.end?.date ? $json.end.date + ' 00:00:00' : '') }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "cGoogleEventId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.summary || '(Sin titulo)' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a5",
              "name": "description",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.description || '' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-1104, 1568],
      "id": "690c72c9-7903-4d14-b9cb-a1adab974c63",
      "name": "Formatear datos"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔁 PROCESAR UNO A UNO\nRecorre los eventos de uno en uno para no saturar la API de EspoCRM con peticiones simultáneas.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-880, 1300],
      "id": "note-5",
      "name": "Nota - Loop"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [-880, 1568],
      "id": "283cc2e6-da1d-4ac8-8de1-56d09bab1666",
      "name": "Loop (1 por 1)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⏱️ PAUSA ANTI RATE-LIMIT\nEspera 0.3s entre eventos para no saturar la API de EspoCRM.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-680, 1220],
      "id": "note-6",
      "name": "Nota - Wait"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 0.3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [-656, 1440],
      "id": "a4a44ec2-8539-416e-ae0e-3a09630bd91b",
      "name": "Esperar (evitar rate limit)",
      "webhookId": "2f36fda9-6c8b-4acd-9de7-032ccaf91d80"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔍 BUSCAR DUPLICADO EN CRM\nConsulta si ya existe una reunión (Meeting) en EspoCRM con ese mismo cGoogleEventId.\n\n⚠️ Sustituye la URL por tu dominio de EspoCRM y usa una credencial de header auth propia en vez de la API key en texto plano.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, 1100],
      "id": "note-7",
      "name": "Nota - Buscar CRM"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://TU-DOMINIO-ESPOCRM.com/api/v1/Meeting?where[0][type]=equals&where[0][attribute]=cGoogleEventId&where[0][value]={{ $json.cGoogleEventId }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Api-Key",
              "value": "TU_ESPOCRM_API_KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-448, 1328],
      "id": "b025224c-ff54-4d9f-a6f2-e4b67ca220ec",
      "name": "Buscar en EspoCRM"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ❓ DECISIÓN\n¿Ese evento ya existe en el CRM?\n- SÍ → Actualizar\n- NO → Crear",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-220, 1220],
      "id": "note-8",
      "name": "Nota - IF"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.total }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-208, 1440],
      "id": "a869dc9d-805e-4018-9f00-39de9b5aed34",
      "name": "¿Ya existe?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✏️ ACTUALIZAR\nSi ya existía, actualiza el registro Meeting en EspoCRM con los datos más recientes del evento de Google Calendar.\n\n⚠️ Sustituye URL y API key.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 1080],
      "id": "note-9",
      "name": "Nota - Actualizar"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=https://TU-DOMINIO-ESPOCRM.com/api/v1/Meeting/{{ $json.list[0].id }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Api-Key",
              "value": "TU_ESPOCRM_API_KEY"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"name\": $('Formatear datos').item.json.name, \"dateStart\": $('Formatear datos').item.json.dateStart, \"dateEnd\": $('Formatear datos').item.json.dateEnd, \"description\": $('Formatear datos').item.json.description } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [0, 1360],
      "id": "ef052d9e-f952-4544-aa33-388800245190",
      "name": "Actualizar Meeting"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ➕ CREAR\nSi no existía, crea un nuevo registro Meeting en EspoCRM y guarda el cGoogleEventId para futuras sincronizaciones.\n\n⚠️ Sustituye URL, API key y assignedUserId por los tuyos.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-16, 1780],
      "id": "note-10",
      "name": "Nota - Crear"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://TU-DOMINIO-ESPOCRM.com/api/v1/Meeting",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Api-Key",
              "value": "TU_ESPOCRM_API_KEY"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"name\": $('Formatear datos').item.json.name, \"dateStart\": $('Formatear datos').item.json.dateStart, \"dateEnd\": $('Formatear datos').item.json.dateEnd, \"description\": $('Formatear datos').item.json.description, \"cGoogleEventId\": $('Formatear datos').item.json.cGoogleEventId, \"assignedUserId\": \"TU_USER_ID\" } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-16, 1616],
      "id": "2aae5f7b-23b2-45a0-9c3f-277ba74a73e7",
      "name": "Crear Meeting"
    }
  ],
